### Test Backend API Endpoints for Partial Sharing

### 1. Build Merkle Tree
POST http://localhost:3000/api/partial-share/build-tree
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recordType": "MEDICATION",
  "fullData": {
    "medicationName": "Aspirin",
    "dosage": "100mg",
    "frequency": "Once daily",
    "prescribedBy": "Dr. Smith",
    "startDate": "2026-01-01",
    "endDate": "2026-12-31",
    "purpose": "Pain relief",
    "sideEffects": "None",
    "pharmacy": "Local Pharmacy"
  }
}

### 2. Generate Proofs (Partial Share)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/partial-share/generate-proofs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recordType": "MEDICATION",
  "fullData": {
    "medicationName": "Aspirin",
    "dosage": "100mg",
    "frequency": "Once daily",
    "prescribedBy": "Dr. Smith",
    "startDate": "2026-01-01",
    "endDate": "2026-12-31",
    "purpose": "Pain relief",
    "sideEffects": "None",
    "pharmacy": "Local Pharmacy"
  },
  "selectedAttributes": ["medicationName", "dosage", "frequency"]
}

### 3. Verify Proofs
POST http://localhost:3000/api/partial-share/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merkleRoot": "YOUR_MERKLE_ROOT_HERE",
  "partialData": {
    "medicationName": "Aspirin",
    "dosage": "100mg"
  },
  "proofs": []
}

### 4. Upload Share Package to IPFS
POST http://localhost:3000/api/partial-share/upload-package
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recordType": "MEDICATION",
  "merkleRoot": "YOUR_MERKLE_ROOT_HERE",
  "partialData": {
    "medicationName": "Aspirin",
    "dosage": "100mg"
  },
  "proofs": [],
  "expiryTime": 1735689600,
  "ownerAddress": "0x123..."
}

### 5. Download Share Package from IPFS
GET http://localhost:3000/api/partial-share/download-package/YOUR_IPFS_HASH_HERE
